# Raw third-party data is never committed (licences: UNOSAT CC BY-NC-SA, OSM ODbL, OpenCity)
data/raw/
logs/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.streamlit/secrets.toml
*.graphml
data/processed/*.geojson
data/processed/*.json
data/processed/*.csv
.env
# web/public/data/ IS committed: it is the generated output the web app reads (derived from
# OpenStreetMap ODbL and OpenCity; not raw third-party data), and a clean clone needs it to run
# without first installing the Python pipeline and the raw datasets. Regenerate it from source
# with `python scripts/build_all.py` after placing the raw datasets in data/raw/ (see SOURCES.md).
